[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13021.83, "timestamp": "03:37:01", "text": "我今天一整天都有空。我会做一对。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13024.63, "timestamp": "03:37:04", "text": "两条溪流或一条溪流。看看它是如何运作的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13027.67, "timestamp": "03:37:07", "text": "走了。是的，明天的活动我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13030.87, "timestamp": "03:37:10", "text": "我将要做的就是维护一个网站。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13033.59, "timestamp": "03:37:13", "text": "我们会这么做。但在那之前，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13035.75, "timestamp": "03:37:15", "text": "我得把推特摘要写完。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13039.51, "timestamp": "03:37:19", "text": "为我目前为止所做的所有直播。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13042.389, "timestamp": "03:37:22", "text": "我落后太多了。我还在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13044.55, "timestamp": "03:37:24", "text": "117."}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13048.79, "timestamp": "03:37:28", "text": "所以，从 117 到 134，就是今天。我有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13050.87, "timestamp": "03:37:30", "text": "写总结，我都写了些什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13053.11, "timestamp": "03:37:33", "text": "做了，而且做了所有事。而且，这很糟糕。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13055.91, "timestamp": "03:37:35", "text": "我无法主动跟进此事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13059.349, "timestamp": "03:37:39", "text": "那就把那件事做完。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13062.309, "timestamp": "03:37:42", "text": "拖延症。那很糟糕。我必须"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13064.389, "timestamp": "03:37:44", "text": "要么做这件事，要么做出决定。不，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13067.51, "timestamp": "03:37:47", "text": "自从我开始积极做这件事以来，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13069.269, "timestamp": "03:37:49", "text": "我想我还是继续这么做吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13072.15, "timestamp": "03:37:52", "text": "与其放弃，不如去做。是的，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13076.95, "timestamp": "03:37:56", "text": "两件事。嗯，我们会的"}]